Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 04:28:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Math environment: reasoning_gym verifier for Reasoning Gym
 tasks

verifier_type: reasoning_gym scores each answer with the scorer of its Reasoning
Gym task. The row's ground truth is a JSON object with the task name and the entry
the scorer reads (question, answer, metadata). The graded frame is reduced to the
last <answer>...</answer>, else the last \boxed{} with balanced braces, else the
whole text. Scorers that eval() or parse_expr the answer are refused, scores below
0.05 count as 0 (several scorers give 0.01 to any wrong answer), and each call has
a 5 s timeout. reasoning_gym is imported in the worker, so only runs that use it
need the package. The env name reasoning_gym maps to MathEnvironment.
---
 nemo_rl/environments/math_environment.py      |   2 +
 .../environments/reasoning_gym_verifier.py    | 150 ++++++++++++++++++
 nemo_rl/environments/utils.py                 |   3 +
 3 files changed, 155 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 nemo_rl/environments/reasoning_gym_verifier.py

